@version: "1.0"

# Compare PathWalker traversal with the standard-library recursive iterator.
# Use --suite source-tree for C++ file reads beneath demos, src, and test.
# For sampling, select one scenario, e.g. --scenario source-tree:src:text --mode profile.

---[ Run ]-------------------------------------------------------------------
Mode                : "benchmark"
Suite               : "snapshot"
Duration            : 30s
Threads             : 1
Seed                : 0x4552'4253'4c41'4e44
Warmup Samples      : 1
Samples             : 7
Minimum Sample Time : 20ms
Memory Limit        : 16 MiB
Progress Interval   : 5s
